From: Tspi Build Fix <builds@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] MediaEngine: avoid private AVStream request_probe field

FFmpeg 4.4 does not expose AVStream::request_probe in its public headers.
PPSSPP already sets need_parsing to AVSTREAM_PARSE_FULL for this stream, so
avoid accessing the unavailable private field.

--- a/Core/HW/MediaEngine.cpp
+++ b/Core/HW/MediaEngine.cpp
@@ -433,6 +433,5 @@
 			avpriv_stream_set_need_parsing(stream, AVSTREAM_PARSE_FULL);
 #else
-			stream->request_probe = 0;
 			stream->need_parsing = AVSTREAM_PARSE_FULL;
 #endif
